.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-preset 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-preset \- Take a vendored preset\*(Aqs modules into this repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten preset\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Take a vendored preset\*(Aqs modules into this repository
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-preset\-eject(1)
Copy a preset module and its call closure into policy/<preset>/ and load the copies instead
.TP
batten\-preset\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
